{"id":"PROP-W0B17-53","text":"System transaction gas must be fixed at SYSTEM_TRANSACTION_GAS (30,000,000). process_system_transaction (SG-008) must use exactly this gas amount.","type":"invariant","source_assumption_id":null,"source_invariant_id":"SG-008/INV-002","source_threat_id":"stride-008","covers":{"primary_element":"SG-008","nodes":["actor-system-address","actor-system-contracts"],"edges":["tb-004"],"is_boundary_edge":true},"reachability":{"classification":"internal-only","entry_points":["Internal"],"attacker_controlled":false,"validation_layers":["System transaction construction"],"bug_bounty_scope":"in-scope","notes":"If system transaction gas is not fixed, a lower value could cause system contracts to fail due to insufficient gas, while a higher value wastes resources."},"exploitability":"internal-bug","severity":"MEDIUM","severity_justification":"Incorrect gas allocation could cause system contract failures (too low) or resource waste (too high).","bug_bounty_eligible":true,"bug_bounty_notes":"Must demonstrate system transaction executing with gas != 30,000,000."}
{"id":"PROP-W0B17-54","text":"System transactions must not transfer value. process_system_transaction (SG-008) must set should_transfer_value=False and value=0.","type":"invariant","source_assumption_id":null,"source_invariant_id":"SG-008/INV-003","source_threat_id":"stride-008","covers":{"primary_element":"SG-008","nodes":["actor-system-address","actor-system-contracts"],"edges":["tb-004"],"is_boundary_edge":true},"reachability":{"classification":"internal-only","entry_points":["Internal"],"attacker_controlled":false,"validation_layers":["System transaction construction"],"bug_bounty_scope":"in-scope","notes":"If value transfer is enabled for system transactions, ETH could be moved from/to the SYSTEM_ADDRESS, creating or destroying supply."},"exploitability":"internal-bug","severity":"CRITICAL","severity_justification":"Value transfer in system transactions could create or destroy ETH, affecting total supply integrity.","bug_bounty_eligible":true,"bug_bounty_notes":"Must demonstrate a system transaction transferring non-zero value."}
{"id":"PROP-W0B17-55","text":"Receipt succeeded field must be True if and only if error is None. make_receipt (SG-007) must set succeeded = (error is None).","type":"post-condition","source_assumption_id":null,"source_invariant_id":"SG-007/INV-001","source_threat_id":"stride-018","covers":{"primary_element":"SG-007","nodes":["actor-evm"],"edges":["tb-006"],"is_boundary_edge":true},"reachability":{"classification":"internal-only","entry_points":["Internal"],"attacker_controlled":false,"validation_layers":["Receipt construction"],"bug_bounty_scope":"in-scope","notes":"If the succeeded field does not match the error state, clients disagree on transaction success/failure. This affects receipt_root computation."},"exploitability":"internal-bug","severity":"HIGH","severity_justification":"Incorrect receipt succeeded field causes receipt_root divergence, leading to consensus failure.","bug_bounty_eligible":true,"bug_bounty_notes":"Must demonstrate a receipt where succeeded != (error is None)."}
{"id":"PROP-W0B17-62","text":"Every error path in transaction validation must terminate by raising an InvalidTransaction subclass. No validation failure may silently succeed.","type":"invariant","source_assumption_id":null,"source_invariant_id":"SG-004/INV-004","source_threat_id":null,"covers":{"primary_element":"SG-004","nodes":["actor-evm"],"edges":["tb-001"],"is_boundary_edge":true},"reachability":{"classification":"external-reachable","entry_points":["Transaction"],"attacker_controlled":true,"validation_layers":["Transaction validation dispatch"],"bug_bounty_scope":"in-scope","notes":"If an error path does not raise an exception, invalid transactions could pass validation silently. An attacker could exploit any missing exception to submit transactions that should be rejected."},"exploitability":"external-attack","severity":"HIGH","severity_justification":"A missing exception in any validation error path allows invalid transactions to be accepted and executed.","bug_bounty_eligible":true,"bug_bounty_notes":"PoC must demonstrate a transaction that should fail validation but is silently accepted."}
{"id":"PROP-W0B17-63","text":"A transaction is valid if and only if it passes all applicable checks. No transaction may be marked valid while failing any validation check, and no transaction may be rejected while passing all checks.","type":"invariant","source_assumption_id":null,"source_invariant_id":"SG-004/INV-005","source_threat_id":null,"covers":{"primary_element":"SG-004","nodes":["actor-tx-sender","actor-evm"],"edges":["tb-001"],"is_boundary_edge":true},"reachability":{"classification":"external-reachable","entry_points":["Transaction"],"attacker_controlled":true,"validation_layers":["Transaction validation dispatch"],"bug_bounty_scope":"in-scope","notes":"Completeness and soundness of the validation dispatch. An attacker exploits any gap between the validation checks and actual transaction validity."},"exploitability":"external-attack","severity":"HIGH","severity_justification":"Incomplete validation allows invalid transactions; overly strict validation rejects valid transactions (DoS).","bug_bounty_eligible":true,"bug_bounty_notes":"PoC must demonstrate either an invalid transaction accepted or a valid transaction rejected by the validation dispatch."}
{"id":"PROP-W0B17-64","text":"Blob data presence must be checked before count validation. blob_transaction_validation (SG-005) must verify blob_versioned_hashes is non-empty before checking count against MAX_BLOB_COUNT.","type":"pre-condition","source_assumption_id":null,"source_invariant_id":"SG-005/INV-001","source_threat_id":null,"covers":{"primary_element":"SG-005","nodes":["actor-tx-sender"],"edges":["tb-008"],"is_boundary_edge":true},"reachability":{"classification":"external-reachable","entry_points":["Transaction"],"attacker_controlled":true,"validation_layers":["Blob transaction validation"],"bug_bounty_scope":"in-scope","notes":"If count is checked before presence, a blob transaction with empty hash list might produce unexpected behavior in the count comparison."},"exploitability":"external-attack","severity":"LOW","severity_justification":"Ordering of checks is defensive; both checks would reject empty blob data regardless of order.","bug_bounty_eligible":false,"bug_bounty_notes":null}
{"id":"PROP-W0B17-65","text":"Blob gas limit must be checked before fee sufficiency. blob_transaction_validation (SG-005) must verify total_blob_gas is within limit before checking max_fee_per_blob_gas >= blob_base_fee.","type":"pre-condition","source_assumption_id":null,"source_invariant_id":"SG-005/INV-002","source_threat_id":null,"covers":{"primary_element":"SG-005","nodes":["actor-tx-sender"],"edges":["tb-008"],"is_boundary_edge":true},"reachability":{"classification":"external-reachable","entry_points":["Transaction"],"attacker_controlled":true,"validation_layers":["Blob transaction validation"],"bug_bounty_scope":"conditional","notes":"Checking fee before gas limit could allow an expensive fee calculation on transactions that would be rejected for exceeding the gas limit."},"exploitability":"external-attack","severity":"LOW","severity_justification":"Primarily a DoS concern for validation ordering, not a correctness issue.","bug_bounty_eligible":false,"bug_bounty_notes":null}

